### 内容审核（需 Bearer，见 samples/_login.http）
@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = <paste_access_token>

### 列表
GET {{base}}/admin/audit/list?page=1&page_size=20&type=notice&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 统计
GET {{base}}/admin/audit/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 审核（:id 为 content_audits 主键）
PUT {{base}}/admin/audit/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "pass",
  "remark": ""
}
